## 6. API 명세서

### 6-1. GET /ingredients
> 빈출 식재료 목록 반환 (FE-1)

**Response 200**
```json
{
  "ingredients": [
    { "id": "uuid", "name": "계란", "category": "단백질" },
    { "id": "uuid", "name": "김치", "category": "발효" }
  ]
}
```

---

### 6-2. POST /recipes/recommend
> 식재료 기반 레시피 추천 (FE-4)

**Request**
```json
{
  "ingredients": ["계란", "김치"],
  "session_id": "uuid"
}
```

**Response 200**
```json
{
  "recipes": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "title": "김치볶음밥",
      "cooking_time_min": 15,
      "matched_ingredients": ["계란", "김치"],
      "source": "db",
      "is_llm_generated": false
    }
  ]
}
```

> `source`: `"db"` (매칭) | `"llm"` (Gemini 생성)

---

### 6-3. GET /recipes/{id}
> 레시피 상세 조회 (FE-5,6)

**Response 200**
```json
{
  "id": "uuid",
  "title": "김치볶음밥",
  "cooking_time_min": 15,
  "instructions": "1. 팬을 달군다\n2. 김치를 볶는다...",
  "ingredients": [
    { "name": "계란", "quantity": "2개", "is_optional": false },
    { "name": "김치", "quantity": "200g", "is_optional": false }
  ],
  "source_url": "https://...",
  "is_llm_generated": false
}
```

---

### 6-4. POST /logs/event
> 클릭 이벤트 로그 (FE-7)

**Request**
```json
{
  "session_id": "uuid",
  "event_type": "recipe_click",
  "recipe_id": "uuid",
  "metadata": {}
}
```

> `event_type`: `"recipe_click"` | `"ingredient_input"` | `"recommend_request"`

**Response 200**
```json
{ "ok": true }
```

